    ParaContent(); print "'";! [8: ~First form from the wood of the ash tree a frame. Put into it the resonant instrument, the ghostly source of light, and the astral focus. Strike the frame with my Rod to create the astral resonator. Ascend the ladder and channel a mighty power through the resonator, directing it towards the crystal eye. Once thou hast done this, illuminate the eye likewise twice more, and the portal shall open, revealing the path to transcendence.~]
