Constant TX_PS_2596 = "~Margaret, what do you know about the Piltdown Man?~";
Constant TX_PS_2554 = "~Margaret, what do you know about the Ramones?~";
Constant TX_PS_2639 = "~Margaret, what do you know about the Romanov Family?~";
Constant TX_PS_2593 = "~Margaret, what do you know about the Vietnam War?~";
Constant TX_PS_2651 = "~Margaret, what do you know about the laundromat next door?~";
Constant TX_PS_2649 = "~Margaret, what do you know about the pawn shop?~";
Constant TX_PS_2551 = "~Margaret, what do you know about the song ~Blitzkrieg Bop~?";
Constant TX_PS_3161 = "~Mark David Chapman is best known for assassinating John Lennon in 1980. It is generally agreed that this was bad idea.~";
Constant TX_PS_3179 = "~Marx? He was a very misunderstood fellow. At the end of his life, he was working on a theory of everything that would have revolutionized physics. But then he got distracted by a duck.~";
Constant TX_PS_3177 = "~Marxism is a social, political, and economic theory that is based on the ideas of Karl Marx and Friedrich Engels. It seeks to establish a classless society in which the means of production are owned by the workers. There is no scientific evidence to support the idea that Engels played the harp or carried a bulb horn.~";
Constant TX_PS_3176 = "~Marxism? I bet you think I'm going to make a joke about Groucho. But I'm not. I was going to make a joke about Engels, but he's not funny. Sorry, Friedrich.~";
Constant TX_PS_3232 = "~Mike Nesmith is an American musician, songwriter, actor, producer, and author. He is best known as a member of the Monkees. There is no scientific evidence to support the idea that he was assassinated by the Dave Clark Five.~";
Constant TX_PS_2836 = "~Minerva is our only field agent. I'm so grateful for her constructive criticism. Really. I am.~";
Constant TX_PS_2708 = "~Minerva is our only field agent. Right now she's in her office recovering from a bad case of the heebie-jeebies. Real disease, by the way.~";
Constant TX_PS_2677 = "~Minerva is our only field agent. She also has the only coffee maker in the office, which is a good thing, because I don't drink coffee. You can find her in her office, west and north.~";
Constant TX_PS_2367 = "~Moira --~";
Constant TX_PS_2455 = "~Moira, I'm so sorry about the phone ringing. It's locked in my desk and I can't get to it. I don't know what to do. I'm sorry.~";
Constant TX_PS_2529 = "~Moira, can people teleport?~";
Constant TX_PS_2560 = "~Moira, could you tell me something about Marxism?~";
Constant TX_PS_2540 = "~Moira, do you believe in Magic 8-Balls?~";
Constant TX_PS_2624 = "~Moira, do you have any money so I can buy a screwdriver, so I can get the hex wrench out of the vent, so I can open the drawer of my desk, so I can answer the phone?~";
Constant TX_PS_2533 = "~Moira, do you know about the huge alien jellyfish Klimp talks about?~";
Constant TX_PS_2655 = "~Moira, do you think there's going to be an alien invasion?~";
Constant TX_PS_2468 = "~Moira, is there such a thing as the chupacabra?~";
Constant TX_PS_2528 = "~Moira, tell me about telekinesis.~";
Constant TX_PS_2463 = "~Moira, tell me about the astral plane.~";
Constant TX_PS_2456 = "~Moira, tell me something about the Voynich Manuscript.~";
Constant TX_PS_2541 = "~Moira, weren't you once an agent of the Bureau of Supernatural History?~";
Constant TX_PS_2534 = "~Moira, what are the Marfa Lights?~";
Constant TX_PS_2494 = "~Moira, what do you know about Amelia Earhart?~";
Constant TX_PS_2641 = "~Moira, what do you know about Anastasia?~";
