Constant TX_PS_662 = "Blake Grouch's new novel is a hard science fiction take on the dangers of AI optometrists. Out beyond the icy rings of Neptune, a lone optometrist struggles to keep his sanity and his vision in a world where the machines have taken over. A 2023 selection for the Eye Doctor's Book Club.";
