Constant TX_PS_3578 = "But Gorm's wife was treacherous, and she lay with lizard people, and she bore a son, and the Lord said, ~I'm not going to smite you, but I'm not going to be happy about it.~";
Constant TX_PS_4068 = "But how can Faraji get past it?";
Constant TX_PS_4004 = "But it is inside something.";
Constant TX_PS_4085 = "But that's not always possible.";
Constant TX_PS_3567 = "But the Lord said to the lizard people, ~You are truly mine enemy, and I will smite you with great vengeance and furious anger. You will know my name is the Lord when I lay my vengeance upon thee.~";
Constant TX_PS_4236 = "But which locker should Faraji open?";
Constant TX_PS_464 = "Butterfree";
Constant TX_PS_3577 = "By the by, Gorm came upon the town of Armagast, and he saw that it was good, and he said, ~I shall build a church here.~ And the Lord said, ~No, don't do that, it's a bad idea.~ And Gorm said, ~But Lord, I have already started.~ And the Lord said, ~Well, okay, but don't say I didn't warn you.~";
