Constant TX_PS_3363 = "Christy frowns. ~I swear pencils used to be better quality.~";
Constant TX_PS_3360 = "Christy glares at the ceiling. ~I swear, if I have to hear one more time about the time Doris and Klimp went to Pompeii, I'm going to scream.~";
Constant TX_PS_266 = "Christy has taken the initiative to paint their office a bright, cheerful orange. A large desk is in the middle of the room.";
Constant TX_PS_3361 = "Christy looks annoyed. ~Why are you hanging around in here?~";
Constant TX_PS_3367 = "Christy looks thoughtful. ~I wonder if I could get a job at the Bureau of Startling Hallucinations. They have a better dental plan.~";
Constant TX_PS_3362 = "Christy looks up at Faraji. ~If I could go back in time, I'd tell myself not to take this job.~";
Constant TX_PS_3359 = "Christy looks up from their scribbling. ~You know, working with Doris is like working with a cat. It's pointless.~";
Constant TX_PS_2013 = "Christy may be soft-spoken, but she's not a pushover.";
Constant TX_PS_3365 = "Christy sharpens their pencil. ~Do you know how many donut shops there are in hyperspace? None! It's a travesty.~";
Constant TX_PS_3366 = "Christy tosses their pencil in the air. ~Just once I'd like to be the one who gets to travel in time.~";
Constant TX_PS_3364 = "Christy yawns. ~You know, working in hyperspace is a terrible commute. Especially when your portal is inside a taco truck that moves every day.~";
