Constant TX_PS_1976 = "Don't mess around with Uncle Sam.";
Constant TX_PS_1710 = "Doogie Howser";
Constant TX_PS_3354 = "Doris fiddles with his TARDIS. ~Some people get all excited about this thing. What's the big deal? It's just a police box.~";
Constant TX_PS_239 = "Doris is sitting cross-legged in a chair, tapping his foot lazily on the desk.";
Constant TX_PS_3348 = "Doris leans back in his chair. ~The Bureau is the only thing standing between us and the end of the world. No pressure, right?~";
Constant TX_PS_3357 = "Doris leans forward confidingly. ~You know, I think there may be a mole in the Bureau. Do you know who it is? No, don't tell me. I'd rather not know.~";
Constant TX_PS_3350 = "Doris looks at Faraji brightly. ~You ever need anything, ask Maggie. She's the best. She's the only one who knows what she's doing around here.~";
Constant TX_PS_3352 = "Doris looks at Faraji. ~You know, I've been thinking about getting a dog. What do you think? No don't tell me. You might say the opposite of what I want to hear.~";
Constant TX_PS_3349 = "Doris looks up from his desk. ~There are things you don't know, Larch. Things that no one knows. Well, except me.~";
Constant TX_PS_4224 = "Doris really needs that thumb drive.";
Constant TX_PS_1106 = "Doris sent me";
Constant TX_PS_3356 = "Doris smiles. ~Did you know I've been to all 55 countries in the world? Some people say there are more, but they're hallucinating.~";
Constant TX_PS_238 = "Doris sports a grin that seems to be permanently etched on his face. He wears a tweed suit and a trilby hat.";
Constant TX_PS_3353 = "Doris taps his fingers on his desk. ~How far back in time do you think I've been? No, don't try to guess. I'll tell you. 2547 BC. Khufu was all the rage back then.~";
Constant TX_PS_3351 = "Doris twiddles his thumbs. ~Have you ever been to Budapest? I haven't either. I hear it's full of Hungarians.~";
