Constant TX_PS_1531 = "He looks pained for a moment. ~Uh, I'd rather you didn't. It's fragile.~";
Constant TX_PS_306 = "He looks taken aback for a moment, then recovers his composure. ~Ah yes, introductions. I'm Doris, chief of the hyperspatial field office of the Bureau.~";
Constant TX_PS_690 = "He may be a crackpot, but Linus Anagram's new book is a must-read for anyone who's ever looked up at the moon and thought ~What the hell is that thing?~";
Constant TX_PS_4169 = "He says he can't focus.";
Constant TX_PS_2924 = "He smiles and replies, ~I've been warming myself by that fireplace for years. It's a comforting sight.~";
Constant TX_PS_1539 = "He thinks for a moment. ~Actually, I need it to keep my computer running properly. It's a long story.~";
Constant TX_PS_462 = "He's dressed in polyester, as if he were still wearing last night's bowling shirt. A bit of tattoo peeks out from his open collar.";
Constant TX_PS_264 = "He's like some strange caricature of Frank Sinatra.";
