Constant TX_PS_921 = "Kind of Crypt Keeper meets Groundskeeper Willie.";
Constant TX_PS_3608 = "Kl";
Constant TX_PS_2952 = "Klimp assumes his lecturing pose. ~You know what I think, of course. They're here, they've been here for decades, maybe centuries, and they're a menace to the human race. We're the only thing standing between them and the end of the world.~";
Constant TX_PS_418 = "Klimp drives a sleek 2017 Porsche 911 Turbo Cabriolet. It is currently empty.";
Constant TX_PS_3486 = "Klimp drums his fingers on the desk and says, ~Savra's going to be the death of us all. Is he an alien? I don't know. But I'm going to find out.~";
Constant TX_PS_3488 = "Klimp flips his pen between his fingers and says, ~Never believe a Freemason when he tells you he's just a guy who likes to wear aprons. They're up to something. I know it. Sometimes. Sometimes I believe the exact opposite.~";
Constant TX_PS_316 = "Klimp is fine";
Constant TX_PS_3490 = "Klimp jumps up from his chair, looks sheepish, and then sits back down. ~Sorry, I was just thinking about Budapest. Scary place. Lots of ghosts. Lots of vampires. Lots of good food.~";
Constant TX_PS_3480 = "Klimp leans back in his chair and says, ~How many people do you think have been abducted by aliens and don't even know it? I'd say at least half. Maybe more.~";
Constant TX_PS_3479 = "Klimp looks around and says, ~I don't like this new office. I liked the old one. It had character. It had history. It had a ghost. I miss that ghost.~";
Constant TX_PS_3485 = "Klimp looks at the ceiling and says, ~I was just thinking about the time I met a guy who said he was a vampire. I didn't believe him, but he had a lot of good ideas about furniture.~";
Constant TX_PS_3489 = "Klimp looks at the clock and says, ~I just know Savra's up to something nefarious. I can feel it in my bones. Or maybe that's just the arthritis acting up.~";
Constant TX_PS_3487 = "Klimp looks at the door and says, ~You ever been to Siberia? They have lots of diners there, believe it or not. Or maybe I was in Pennsylvania. I can't remember.~";
Constant TX_PS_3483 = "Klimp looks out the window and says, ~I was just thinking about the future of the Bureau. Savra's going to ruin everything. I have a feeling he's not quite human.~";
Constant TX_PS_3478 = "Klimp scratches his head and says, ~You ever been to Istanbul? I met a guy there who said he was a time traveler. I didn't believe him, but he had a watch that was always right.~";
Constant TX_PS_3491 = "Klimp smiles and says, ~I have such a good feeling about today. I think we're going to solve the mystery of the Black Knight Satellite. Or maybe we'll just have a good lunch. Either way, it's a win.~";
Constant TX_PS_3481 = "Klimp taps his fingers on the desk and says, ~Did I ever tell you about my friend Doris? We went a lot of places together back when the Bureau was just starting out. He's a good guy. A bit of a liar, but a good guy.~";
Constant TX_PS_3484 = "Klimp taps his foot and says, ~You ever eat too much pizza and then have a dream about being chased by a giant pizza? I have. It's not fun.~";
Constant TX_PS_3482 = "Klimp yawns theatrically and says, ~I was up all night reading about the founding of the Illuminati. Did you know they were originally a secret society of bakers? They made the best bread in Bavaria.~";
Constant TX_PS_1592 = "Klimp's Computer";
Constant TX_PS_419 = "Klimp's Porsche takes up two spots.";
