Constant TX_PS_3346 = "Minerva clicks her tongue. ~I'm busy. What do you want?~";
Constant TX_PS_3345 = "Minerva cocks an eyebrow. ~If you're coming to me because Maggie's being weird, I can't help you.~";
Constant TX_PS_213 = "Minerva exudes an air of competence and no-nonsense business. Her expression is serious and focused.";
Constant TX_PS_3344 = "Minerva leans back. ~If you're going to ask me a question, make it a good one.~";
Constant TX_PS_3342 = "Minerva looks bothered. ~What is it now?~";
Constant TX_PS_231 = "Minerva looks up from her computer. ~Sure, help yourself.~";
Constant TX_PS_3341 = "Minerva looks up from her computer. ~Yes? Don't tell me, I know. You want to borrow a book.~";
Constant TX_PS_218 = "Minerva notices Faraji looking at her papers and gives them a look that says ~Mind your own business.~";
Constant TX_PS_3347 = "Minerva sighs deeply. ~If Christy is being difficult, work it out with them. I'm not a mediator.~";
Constant TX_PS_3969 = "Minerva will allow Faraji to borrow a book.";
